<h2>Flood Due Diligence for Any Suburb</h2>
<p>Flooding in the Houston area does not stay inside mapped flood zones. Before you write an offer, look up the address on <a href="https://msc.fema.gov/portal/home">FEMA's Flood Map Service Center</a>, read the seller's disclosure closely and get a flood insurance quote. Remember that a new flood policy through the NFIP generally has a 30-day waiting period. Our guide to <a href="/blog/buying-a-house-in-a-flood-zone-houston/">buying a house in a flood zone in Houston</a> walks through the full checklist.</p>
