<p>Before you shop, run your budget through our <a href="/tools/home-affordability-calculator/">home affordability calculator</a> with realistic tax and insurance numbers for each suburb. A licensed lender can confirm what you qualify for.</p>

<h2>Bottom Line</h2>
<p>The best Houston suburbs for families each trade off commute, school district, taxes and flood exposure differently. Narrow your list by where you work, confirm the zoned schools and total tax rate for each address, and investigate flood history street by street. If you are relocating from out of state, our <a href="/blog/moving-to-houston/">guide to moving to Houston</a> covers the rest of the transition.</p>
